{"id": "L01", "source": "DR-kestrel-001:p0002_b003", "text": "In FY2025 Kestrel processed over $4.9bn in payment volume", "tokens": [{"span": "FY2025", "label": "exclude", "type": "period"}, {"span": "$4.9bn", "label": "number", "value": 4900000000.0}]}
{"id": "L02", "source": "DR-kestrel-001:p0003_b002", "text": "Kestrel reported FY2025 revenue of $96.4m, and net revenue grew 31% in FY2025", "tokens": [{"span": "FY2025", "label": "exclude", "type": "period"}, {"span": "$96.4m", "label": "number", "value": 96400000.0}, {"span": "31%", "label": "number", "value": 0.31}, {"span": "FY2025", "label": "exclude", "type": "period"}]}
{"id": "L03", "source": "DR-kestrel-001:p0004_b004", "text": "management expects CY2025 net revenue of $64.2m, reflecting the first half of FY2026.", "tokens": [{"span": "CY2025", "label": "exclude", "type": "period"}, {"span": "$64.2m", "label": "number", "value": 64200000.0}, {"span": "FY2026", "label": "exclude", "type": "period"}]}
{"id": "L04", "source": "DR-kestrel-001:p0005_b002", "text": "giving the Company 92% recurring revenue. Subscription ARR of $21.0m¹ underpins visibility.", "tokens": [{"span": "92%", "label": "number", "value": 0.92}, {"span": "$21.0m", "label": "number", "value": 21000000.0}, {"span": "¹", "label": "exclude", "type": "footnote_marker"}]}
{"id": "L05", "source": "DR-kestrel-001:p0009_b004", "text": "Management presents adjusted EBITDA of $15.8m for FY2025, after adding back stock-based compensation ($4.6m), a one-off legal settlement ($1.2m) and fraud losses ($2.1m)", "tokens": [{"span": "$15.8m", "label": "number", "value": 15800000.0}, {"span": "FY2025", "label": "exclude", "type": "period"}, {"span": "($4.6m)", "label": "number", "value": 4600000.0}, {"span": "($1.2m)", "label": "number", "value": 1200000.0}, {"span": "($2.1m)", "label": "number", "value": 2100000.0}]}
{"id": "L06", "source": "DR-kestrel-001:p0010_b002", "text": "co-founded Kestrel in 2016 after a decade in healthcare billing. Omar Feld, Chief Financial Officer, joined in 2022", "tokens": [{"span": "2016", "label": "exclude", "type": "year"}, {"span": "2022", "label": "exclude", "type": "year"}]}
{"id": "L07", "source": "DR-kestrel-002:p0001_b003", "text": "1. Term. This Agreement commences on January 1, 2023 and continues for five (5) years.", "tokens": [{"span": "1.", "label": "exclude", "type": "item_number"}, {"span": "January 1, 2023", "label": "exclude", "type": "date"}, {"span": "(5)", "label": "number", "value": 5.0}]}
{"id": "L08", "source": "DR-kestrel-002:p0001_b004", "text": "2. Program fees. Program Manager pays Bank 0.04% of settled volume", "tokens": [{"span": "2.", "label": "exclude", "type": "item_number"}, {"span": "0.04%", "label": "number", "value": 0.0004}]}
{"id": "L09", "source": "DR-kestrel-003:p0001_b002", "text": "1. Term: 36 months from March 1, 2024. 4. Revenue share: Partner receives 18% of net revenue from referred clinics.", "tokens": [{"span": "1.", "label": "exclude", "type": "item_number"}, {"span": "36", "label": "number", "value": 36.0}, {"span": "March 1, 2024", "label": "exclude", "type": "date"}, {"span": "4.", "label": "exclude", "type": "item_number"}, {"span": "18%", "label": "number", "value": 0.18}]}
{"id": "L10", "source": "DR-kestrel-003:p0001_b003", "text": "6. Minimum volume: referred clinics to process at least $600 million per contract year.", "tokens": [{"span": "6.", "label": "exclude", "type": "item_number"}, {"span": "$600 million", "label": "number", "value": 600000000.0}]}
{"id": "L11", "source": "DR-kestrel-006:p0006_b002", "text": "Kestrel earns a net take rate of 1.45% on volume processed.", "tokens": [{"span": "1.45%", "label": "number", "value": 0.0145}]}
{"id": "L12", "source": "DR-kestrel-006:p0007_b002", "text": "Best-in-class expansion: NRR of 128%.", "tokens": [{"span": "128%", "label": "number", "value": 1.28}]}
{"id": "L13", "source": "DR-kestrel-006:p0007_b003", "text": "Q4 FY2025, annualized.", "tokens": [{"span": "Q4", "label": "exclude", "type": "period"}, {"span": "FY2025", "label": "exclude", "type": "period"}]}
{"id": "L14", "source": "DR-kestrel-008:t003", "text": "[00:01:47] Omar Feld (CFO): Sure. On a trailing twelve-month basis it's, um, net revenue retention of about 112%.", "tokens": [{"span": "00:01:47", "label": "exclude", "type": "date"}, {"span": "112%", "label": "number", "value": 1.12}]}
{"id": "L15", "source": "DR-kestrel-008:t001", "text": "Management call, Project Kestrel, September 9, 2026", "tokens": [{"span": "September 9, 2026", "label": "exclude", "type": "date"}]}
{"id": "L16", "source": "0001628280-26-058238:1_b0007", "text": "As of June 30, 2026, approximately 479,300 businesses used our solutions and processed approximately $371.3 billion in Total Payment Volume (TPV) during fiscal 2026.", "tokens": [{"span": "June 30, 2026", "label": "exclude", "type": "date"}, {"span": "479,300", "label": "number", "value": 479300.0}, {"span": "$371.3 billion", "label": "number", "value": 371300000000.0}, {"span": "fiscal 2026", "label": "exclude", "type": "period"}]}
{"id": "L17", "source": "0001628280-26-058238:1A_b0027", "text": "We generated a net loss of $11.2 million, net income of $23.8 million, and a net loss of $28.9 million for fiscal 2026, 2025, and 2024, respectively.", "tokens": [{"span": "$11.2 million", "label": "number", "value": 11200000.0}, {"span": "$23.8 million", "label": "number", "value": 23800000.0}, {"span": "$28.9 million", "label": "number", "value": 28900000.0}, {"span": "fiscal 2026", "label": "exclude", "type": "period"}, {"span": "2025", "label": "exclude", "type": "year"}, {"span": "2024", "label": "exclude", "type": "year"}]}
{"id": "L18", "source": "0001193125-26-067540:7_b0012", "text": "We have grown our total payment volume by approximately 26.4% period-over-period from $29.7 billion during the year ended December 31, 2024 to $37.6 billion during the year ended December 31, 2025.", "tokens": [{"span": "26.4%", "label": "number", "value": 0.264}, {"span": "$29.7 billion", "label": "number", "value": 29700000000.0}, {"span": "December 31, 2024", "label": "exclude", "type": "date"}, {"span": "$37.6 billion", "label": "number", "value": 37600000000.0}, {"span": "December 31, 2025", "label": "exclude", "type": "date"}]}
