{"id": "L23", "source": "0001123360-26-000008:1A_b0155", "text": "in \"Item 1 - Business\" of this Annual Report on Form 10-K.", "tokens": [{"span": "Item 1", "label": "exclude", "type": "item_number"}, {"span": "10-K", "label": "exclude", "type": "form"}]}
{"id": "L24", "source": "0001633917-26-000024:1_b0103", "text": "As of December 31, 2025, we employed approximately 23,800 people globally, with 46% in the Americas, 42% in Asia-Pacific, and 12% in Europe and the Middle East.", "tokens": [{"span": "December 31, 2025", "label": "exclude", "type": "date"}, {"span": "23,800", "label": "number", "value": 23800.0}, {"span": "46%", "label": "number", "value": 0.46}, {"span": "42%", "label": "number", "value": 0.42}, {"span": "12%", "label": "number", "value": 0.12}]}
{"id": "L25", "source": "0001633917-26-000024:7_b0022", "text": "Operating income increased $740 million, or 14%, in 2025 compared to 2024", "tokens": [{"span": "$740 million", "label": "number", "value": 740000000.0}, {"span": "14%", "label": "number", "value": 0.14}, {"span": "2025", "label": "exclude", "type": "year"}, {"span": "2024", "label": "exclude", "type": "year"}]}
{"id": "L26", "source": "0001650164-26-000057:1_b0098", "text": "included in Part I, Item 1A of this Annual Report on Form 10-K.", "tokens": [{"span": "Item 1A", "label": "exclude", "type": "item_number"}, {"span": "10-K", "label": "exclude", "type": "form"}]}
{"id": "L27", "source": "0001650164-26-000057:1A_b0018", "text": "in the fiscal years ended December 31, 2025 and 2024, our revenue was $6,153 million and $4,960 million, respectively, representing a 24% growth rate.", "tokens": [{"span": "December 31, 2025", "label": "exclude", "type": "date"}, {"span": "2024", "label": "exclude", "type": "year"}, {"span": "$6,153 million", "label": "number", "value": 6153000000.0}, {"span": "$4,960 million", "label": "number", "value": 4960000000.0}, {"span": "24%", "label": "number", "value": 0.24}]}
{"id": "L28", "source": "0001650164-26-000057:7_b0115", "text": "(2) Excludes $123 million of cash held on behalf of customers and $59 million of restricted cash.", "tokens": [{"span": "(2)", "label": "exclude", "type": "item_number"}, {"span": "$123 million", "label": "number", "value": 123000000.0}, {"span": "$59 million", "label": "number", "value": 59000000.0}]}
